    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d413">

                <pb facs="0567" n="461" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg461"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chinese consul-general to Mr. Tsui</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Francisco</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-07-24"><hi rendition="#italic">July 24,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Chinese merchants at Vallejo, Cal., have recently been repeatedly outraged,
                    robbed, and murdered. Please communicate with the State Department, with a
                    request that instructions be sent by telegraph to extend protection to them.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Li Yung Yew</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
